---
const { heading = "Let’s find your daylight." } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="grid">
    <div>
      <div class="k">05 — Contact</div>
      <h2>{heading}</h2>
      <p>If you have invested in better data, sharper targeting and the same tools as everyone else, and the returns have flattened, the problem is the frame rather than the execution. Tell us what you are working on and we will come back with a straight answer on whether, and how, we can help.</p>
      <p class="email">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:hello@thisisrupture.com">hello@thisisrupture.com</a></p>
    </div>
    <form name="contact" method="POST" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit">
      <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="a1c47d7f-da1d-4642-845e-841bac266acc" />
      <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New enquiry from thisisrupture.com" />
      <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="This is Rupture website" />
      <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://thisisrupture.com/thanks" />
      <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="botcheck" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <label><span>Name</span>
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Enter your name" required />
      </label>
      <label><span>Email</span>
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required />
      </label>
      <label><span>The problem</span>
        <textarea name="problem" rows="3" placeholder="What are you working on?"></textarea>
      </label>
      <div><button type="submit">Send message</button></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact { border:var(--hairline); background:var(--ink); color:var(--fg-on-dark); padding:56px; }
  .grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:64px; }
  .k { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--mint); margin-bottom:24px; }
  h2 { font-family:var(--font-serif); font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.4vw,3.2rem); line-height:1.04; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:0 0 24px; }
  p { font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.6; color:var(--fg-on-dark-muted); margin:0 0 20px; max-width:40ch; }
  .email { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--fg-on-dark); }
  .email a { color:var(--mint); }
  form { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:26px; }
  .botcheck { position:absolute; left:-9999px; opacity:0; }
  label { display:block; }
  label span { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--mint); }
  input, textarea { font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:1rem; color:var(--fg-on-dark); background:transparent; border:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg-on-dark-faint); padding:0.6em 0; width:100%; outline:none; transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease); }
  input:focus, textarea:focus { border-color: var(--mint); }
  button { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:500; padding:0.9em 1.6em; border:1.5px solid var(--mint); border-radius:var(--radius-button); background:var(--mint); color:var(--ink); cursor:pointer; transition: background var(--dur) var(--ease), transform var(--dur) var(--ease); }
  button:hover { background: var(--accent-press); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .contact { padding:32px 24px; } .grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:36px; } }
</style>
